==========================\n","PDF encontrados: 4\n","Documentos procesados: 4\n","Documentos con texto: 4\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["¿Qué debemos verificar?\n","\n","- Que los cuatro documentos se procesen sin errores.\n","- Que caracteres sea mayor que cero para cada PDF.\n","- Que las páginas con texto no sean cero. Si un documento no contiene texto extraíble, podría necesitar OCR.\n","- Que los textos correspondan realmente con el tema cardiovascular."],"metadata":{"id":"lRQHaWwhslGF"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Paso 1. Dividir los documentos en fragmentos (chunks)\n","\n","No conviene enviar cada PDF completo al modelo de embeddings. Los fragmentos más pequeños permiten recuperar pasajes específicos y relacionarlos con sus fuentes.\n","Para este primer experimento utilizaremos:\n","- Tamaño: 800 caracteres.\n","- Solapamiento: 120 caracteres.\n","- Metadatos: nombre del documento, página de origen e identificador del fragmento.\n","- Unidad de división: página, evitando mezclar directamente el texto de páginas distintas.\n","Estos valores son parámetros iniciales que podremos evaluar posteriormente; no son necesariamente los óptimos."],"metadata":{"id":"5QfB0PmBsxbP"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["\n","# ============================================================\n","# 4.3. CHUNKING DEL CORPUS DOCUMENTAL\n","# ============================================================\n","\n","CHUNK_SIZE = 800\n","CHUNK_OVERLAP = 120\n","\n","chunks = []\n","\n","for doc in documentos:\n","    for pagina in doc[\"paginas\"]:\n","        texto = pagina[\"texto\"]\n","\n","        # Limpiar espacios y saltos de línea redundantes\n","        texto = \" \".join(texto.split())\n","\n","        if not texto:\n","            continue\n","\n","        inicio = 0\n","\n","        while inicio < len(texto):\n","            fin = min(inicio + CHUNK_SIZE, len(texto))\n","            fragmento = texto[inicio:fin].strip()\n","\n","            if fragmento:\n","                chunks.append({\n","                    \"chunk_id\": f\"chunk_{len(chunks):06d}\",\n","                    \"documento\": doc[\"documento\"],\n","                    \"pagina\": pagina[\"pagina\"],\n","                    \"texto\": fragmento,\n","                    \"caracteres\": len(fragmento)\n","                })\n","\n","            if fin >= len(texto):\n","                break\n","\n","            inicio = fin - CHUNK_OVERLAP\n","\n","print(\"Documentos procesados:\", len(documentos))\n","print(\"Total de chunks:\", len(chunks))\n","\n","if chunks:\n","    longitudes = [c[\"caracteres\"] for c in chunks]\n","\n","    print(\"Caracteres promedio por chunk:\", round(\n","        sum(longitudes) / len(longitudes), 2\n","    ))\n","    print(\"Chunk más corto:\", min(longitudes))\n","    print(\"Chunk más largo:\", max(longitudes))\n","\n","    print(\"\\nEjemplo de chunk:\")\n","    print(\"ID:\", chunks[0][\"chunk_id\"])\n","    print(\"Documento:\", chunks[0][\"documento\"])\n","    print(\"Página:\", chunks[0][\"pagina\"])\n","    print(\"Texto:\")\n","    print(chunks[0][\"texto\"][:500])\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"5B9yclUDs44K","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791986227885,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":49,"user":{"displayName":"JUAN MANUEL BETANCUR LOPEZ","userId":"09952323565785544167"}},"outputId":"0dcd08cd-0ab0-4338-edc0-dc399b07f804"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Documentos procesados: 4\n","Total de chunks: 1858\n","Caracteres promedio por chunk: 712.97\n","Chunk más corto: 3\n","Chunk más largo: 800\n","\n","Ejemplo de chunk:\n","ID: chunk_000000\n","Documento: 01_gcp-completa-sindrome-coronario-agudo-2da-ed.pdf\n","Página: 1\n","Texto:\n","El Síndrome Coronario Agudo Guía de práctica clínica para Sistema General de Seguridad Social en Salud – Colombia Guía Completa 2a. Edición GPC-2013-17 Centro Nacional de Investigación y Tecnologías en Salud, CINETS\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Paso 3. Seleccionar el modelo de embeddings\n","Como el corpus está en español, utilizaremos intfloat/multilingual-e5-small. Es un modelo multilingüe apropiado para búsqueda semántica y genera vectores de 384 dimensiones.\n","Para la indexación y las consultas, este modelo requiere los prefijos passage:  y query: , respectivamente. Debemos mantenerlos para que la búsqueda sea consistente.\n","\n","### Paso 4. Filtrar y generar embeddings"],"metadata":{"id":"hkHruS_GvhQL"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["\n","# ============================================================\n","# 4.4. LIMPIEZA FINAL Y GENERACIÓN DE EMBEDDINGS\n","# ============================================================\n","\n","\n","\n","# Filtrar fragmentos con menos de 50 caracteres.\n","# Es un criterio inicial que podremos ajustar.\n","MIN_CHUNK_LENGTH = 50\n","\n","chunks_validos = [\n","    chunk for chunk in chunks\n","    if len(chunk[\"texto\"].strip()) >= MIN_CHUNK_LENGTH\n","]\n","\n","print(\"Chunks originales:\", len(chunks))\n","print(\"Chunks conservados:\", len(chunks_validos))\n","print(\"Chunks descartados:\", len(chunks) - len(chunks_validos))\n","\n","# Cargar modelo multilingüe\n","MODEL_NAME = \"intfloat/multilingual-e5-small\"\n","embedding_model = SentenceTransformer(MODEL_NAME)\n","\n","# Prefijo requerido para documentos en E5\n","textos = [\n","    \"passage: \" + chunk[\"texto\"]\n","    for chunk in chunks_validos\n","]\n","\n","embeddings = embedding_model.encode(\n","    textos,\n","    batch_size=32,\n","    show_progress_bar=True,\n","    convert_to_numpy=True,\n","    normalize_embeddings=True\n",")\n","\n","print(\"\\nDimensiones de la matriz:\", embeddings.shape)\n","print(\"Dimensión por vector:\", embeddings.shape[1])\n","print(\"Total de embeddings:\", len(embeddings))\n","\n","# Validaciones\n","assert len(embeddings) == len(chunks_validos)\n","assert embeddings.shape[1] == 384\n","assert np.isfinite(embeddings).all()\n","\n","normas = np.linalg.norm(embeddings, axis=1)\n","print(\"Norma mínima:\", round(float(normas.min()), 4))\n","print(\"Norma máxima:\", round(float(normas.max()), 4))\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":708,"referenced_widgets":["59fce421ae824df6a0aa08254f767f63","9fec0a4f833e40bd8c1338b869d9c5e5","58ce36207d444797b94d3bc3679f6528","25188579206a4ab3b84af17b97323da2","82e1cd5d99bb4088bef3799f71e4044f","3d6bde22c27d4842972476e0c1cc9619","a5f6a49cec214d61b21b25ed8cec7a27","065c8a5bb47341e49db876e9b08672f4","87b65e4bfd6047c3b478276f4391b2ef","7fa283a693cd4de083849b7ec36fe498","c9e5056198c34e5dbd2c94c1acdf46eb","716c151e447c488ea187ec44c0c5fdce","6befd11e7f26451eafccab2211cecf45","c0465a93cc1646809f4a4c66a94e5705","4eb159fe2da844f5a1a364b3f9d37fa9","7f880d81c506425f8cdb5270cc828705","63bf266ab5a54ceab12a31f1efc26718","d9dca23f1f5f42d18b8da3b665ad2fe2","be8016d419e04d039c7358ca88466bfa","41b70de187b24328898218cbcb9fc533","6d4786626fd5460789749d7fe911def4","14a2c6dac6ef462f9f10ecfeb3c39f36","b0e322ca2d1941658fe5575047bda9a6","f81a80a22a2a40b3b76af41dfb708b42","15b94016b3224064a3e35b0643102a71","0bee107a991b41e38f3b152e5a7c99a3","1b3c5d2515164e3d9eac61a59f74f4d9","70ed614157044d2f8448a0b30a6175c2","fd2fd732a39b4e029cecc5e3b9fca8f4","107b6a21782a4e8f8e0e0ce692a3b15b","2912fc656fdd43c0b664ffa34604df03","0ca680b32f0a401b84f33e78464401ab","a6e370d3b39b4719b09e0ac124a69beb","dab83e69cd1846a9a27f2834b9a01e93","c663f81f067044a1be80ccc14607711a","f2ee42d2fded42498685f62a9a68eb43","51ddd65ee9c9420dbdf2141fe31b073f","896bffbd0ca24c228aa9d6ed2f0c5f32","968ada95fb534a44a3816f8ec08a8388","7e1b6db6f75e4ce1aef21f0633963895","c02cc474c2fc4904bd262c7228afeb0e","387083c79ad14b7cbf6031d42f98261e","f03a6265240a4c26a8b76ee4699c0f28","02db3629f9504ec2a0a36a696f9ccb28","2c581ff8380644028937bd288bf41e30","cbbda75a76374793a05eee61fe2c609f","1046c612e9734a27aefedb1fb9009d7e","0d93ee4fed8241febe41259ca3f32204","c072376cd5534f5990e